'''Panda Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked by opening a daily login reward from the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 606
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Panda Cat
|name2 = Genma Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Genma Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Basically a [[Thief Cat (Rare Cat)|Thief Cat]] with higher attack power but a much slower attack rate and higher cost, meaning there is little usage for this unit outside of very early-game. His Single Target only makes things worse, further limiting his usage.

{{Job|Classification = Melee & User Rank Dump}}

